I tell my story to Neha, Amit, and Sanjay.
"I came to Mumbai in January," I tell them.
I got a job in a software company here.
So I came here from Mexico.
That was my first day in Mumbai.
There was a lot of crowd at the airport.
I had very heavy bags.
I came out of the airport.
There were many people and taxis outside.
I got a little scared.
There was a piece of paper in my hand.
The address of my new house was on it.
I went near a taxi.
I gave that paper to the taxi driver 'dada'.
"Dada, I want to go to this address," I said.
Dada read that address.
He said to me, "Madam, sit in the car."
He put my heavy bags in the car.
I sat in the taxi and looked out the window.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay listen to my story carefully.
